                    "content": "```java\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = scanner.nextInt();\n        int m = scanner.nextInt();\n        int c0 = scanner.nextInt();\n        int d0 = scanner.nextInt();\n\n        int[] dp = new int[n + 1];\n        Arrays.fill(dp, 0);\n\n        // Unbounded knapsack for buns without stuffing\n        for (int j = c0; j <= n; j++) {\n            dp[j] = Math.max(dp[j], dp[j - c0] + d0);\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            int a = scanner.nextInt();\n            int b = scanner.nextInt();\n            int c = scanner.nextInt();\n            int d = scanner.nextInt();\n\n            int count = a / b; // maximum number of buns of this stuffing type we can make based on stuffing availability\n\n            // Bounded knapsack: do 0/1 knapsack 'count' times\n            for (int k = 0; k < count; k++) {\n                for (int j = n; j >= c; j--) {\n                    dp[j] = Math.max(dp[j], dp[j - c] + d);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        int ans = 0;\n        for (int j = 0; j <= n; j++) {\n            ans = Math.max(ans, dp[j]);\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n}\n```",
